00:47:40,486 --> 00:47:45,446
今日はつけよっかな 靴擦れじゃ困らない
Maybe I'll put some on today so I don't get blisters.

425
00:47:46,586 --> 00:47:50,946
私しか 困らない
Only I would be troubled.

426
00:47:52,006 --> 00:48:01,346
どうせ忘れちゃうとして 上書きしちゃうとして でもね いつかは思い出すから
Even if I'm bound to forget and overwrite it eventually, I know I'll remember someday.

427
00:48:06,206 --> 00:48:11,446
しょせん人手すから お土産はいつものネット
After all, souvenirs can just be ordered online as usual.

428
00:48:16,406 --> 00:48:21,166
私と猫の分 それで十分
Just enough for me and my cat.

429
00:48:22,166 --> 00:48:29,926
ああ 見慣れた家電に安心する カーテンはうちの匂い 離れて気付く 私の輪郭
Familiar appliances bring comfort; the curtains smell like home. Being away makes me realize who I am.

430
00:48:32,966 --> 00:48:37,566
少々真面目の傷心旅行
A somewhat serious heartbroken journey.

431
00:48:38,026 --> 00:48:42,646
誰にも言わずに家を出る
I left home without telling a soul.

432
00:48:43,166 --> 00:48:48,406
結局知でいる店に逃げ この少々さえ愛してる
I end up escaping to a familiar shop, and I love even this foolishness.

433
00:48:52,946 --> 00:49:02,206
ああ 安心状態の傷心旅行から 戻ったよと伝えたい
Ah, I want to tell you I've returned from my heartbroken journey with a peaceful mind.

434
00:49:03,366 --> 00:49:11,406
それが誰かわからないけど あなただといい ただいま 帰ったよ
I don't know who you are, but I hope it's you. I'm back, I'm home.

435
00:49:41,072 --> 00:49:43,072
雨燦々
Ame Sansan

436
00:49:50,572 --> 00:49:56,072
選べよ 変わりゆく時代を
Choose the changing times,

437
00:49:56,872 --> 00:49:59,872
割り切れなくとも
even if you can't make sense of it all.

438
00:50:00,435 --> 00:50:04,465
この瞬間 この舞台を生き抜くから
Because in this moment, on this stage, I will survive it all.

439
00:50:05,235 --> 00:50:10,435
手答えの無い 今日でさえも
Even on days like today, which offer no answers...

440
00:50:11,205 --> 00:50:16,405
紡ぐよ でこぼこな此の道に
We weave our tale along this bumpy road.

441
00:50:17,175 --> 00:50:20,675
降り注ぐ 雨燦々と
As the rain pours down brilliantly,

442
00:50:21,095 --> 00:50:23,095
と悩ましき
troubled and perplexed,

443
00:50:23,095 --> 00:50:25,095
生き惑う僕らの
we wander through life.

444
00:50:25,395 --> 00:50:29,895
悲しみさえも 水に流してゆく
Washing away even our sadness with the water.

445
00:50:30,305 --> 00:50:34,505
錆びついた 自転車を走らせて
Riding on a rusted bicycle,

446
00:50:34,705 --> 00:50:37,105
君へと向かうのさ
I'm heading towards you.

447
00:50:37,405 --> 00:50:43,105
雨に濡れながら帰ろう
Let's go home, getting soaked in the rain.

448
00:50:52,635 --> 00:50:55,435
臨時ニュースの報せでは
According to a breaking news flash,

449
00:50:55,935 --> 00:51:01,435
どうやらこれから 土砂降りの雨が降るらしい
it seems a heavy downpour is about to start.

450
00:51:02,235 --> 00:51:05,835
傘を忘れた ため息は
The sigh of leaving my umbrella behind

451
00:51:06,135 --> 00:51:11,835
夕立ちが連れてきた 夏の匂いに解けてゆく
dissolves into the scent of summer brought by the evening shower.

452
00:51:12,435 --> 00:51:17,435
過去を呪う悲しみ達が 雲となり雨を打ちつける
The sorrows cursing the past turn into clouds and beat down rain.

453
00:51:17,935 --> 00:51:21,435
叫べよ 気の晴れるまで
Scream out until your spirit clears,

454
00:51:21,735 --> 00:51:25,435
声は 雨にかき消され
your voice drowned out by the rain.

455
00:51:25,935 --> 00:51:30,435
今じゃ何処の誰にも届かなくても
Even if it doesn't reach anyone anywhere now,

456
00:51:30,735 --> 00:51:35,435
手遅れになってしまった 未来へさえも
and even to a future that has become too late,

457
00:51:36,035 --> 00:51:40,035
繋ぐよ そのバトンを
we pass on that baton.

458
00:51:46,135 --> 00:51:50,035
静かに待っている人がいる
There are people waiting quietly.

459
00:51:50,635 --> 00:51:53,435
雨燦々と 悩ましき
Pouring down brilliantly, troubled...

460
00:51:53,835 --> 00:51:55,835
生き惑う僕らの
we wander through life.

461
00:51:56,135 --> 00:52:00,735
悲しみさえも 水に流してゆく
Washing away even our sadness with the water.

462
00:52:01,235 --> 00:52:05,735
線路沿い 風を切り 直線に君へと向かうのさ
Cutting through the wind along the railway, heading straight to you.

463
00:52:08,135 --> 00:52:14,435
雨に濡れながら帰ろう
Let's go home, getting soaked in the rain.

464
00:52:18,235 --> 00:52:20,435
みおしゃ お誕生日おめでとう！
Mio-sha, happy birthday!

465
00:52:21,235 --> 00:52:24,435
みおしゃ！ お誕生日おめでとうございます！
Mio-sha! Happy birthday!

466
00:52:24,835 --> 00:52:31,635
お誕生日おめでとう！ みおしゃ！ お誕生日おめでとう！
Happy birthday! Mio-sha! Happy birthday!

467
00:52:32,135 --> 00:52:37,435
みおしゃ！お誕生日おめでとう！ハッピーバースデー！みおしゃ！
Mio-sha! Happy birthday! Happy birthday, Mio-sha!

468
00:52:38,135 --> 00:52:43,135
みおちゃん お誕生日おめでとう！みおちゃん！ハッピーバースデー！
Mio-chan, happy birthday! Mio-chan! Happy birthday!

469
00:52:44,135 --> 00:52:51,435
みおちゃん お誕生日おめでとう！みおちゃん！お誕生日おめでとう！
Mio-chan, happy birthday! Mio-chan, happy birthday!

470
00:52:52,135 --> 00:52:57,435
夏を泳いでずぶ濡れの 僕らを映し出す
Reflecting us, drenched from swimming through summer.

471
00:52:58,235 --> 00:53:07,635
烈しく照りつける太陽よ 僕らを導いておくれよ
O sun that fervently beats down, please guide us.

472
00:53:08,135 --> 00:53:17,435
未来を謳う言葉だけが 風となり森を吹き抜ける
Only words singing of the future become the wind blowing through the forest.

473
00:53:22,635 --> 00:53:28,435
選べよ 変わりゆく時代を
Choose the changing era,

474
00:53:29,135 --> 00:53:31,435
割り切れなくとも
even if you can't accept it fully.

475
00:53:31,935 --> 00:53:36,635
この瞬間 この舞台を生き抜くから
Because in this moment, on this stage, I will survive it all.

476
00:53:37,835 --> 00:53:42,435
青き春の瞬きから 何度目覚めようとも
No matter how many times we awaken from the flash of youth's spring,

477
00:53:43,135 --> 00:53:48,435
紡ぐよ でこぼこな此の道に
we weave our tale along this bumpy road.

478
00:53:49,135 --> 00:53:52,135
降り注ぐ 雨燦々と
As the rain pours down brilliantly,

479
00:53:52,535 --> 00:53:54,535
と悩ましき
troubled and perplexed,

480
00:53:54,735 --> 00:53:56,735
生き惑う僕らの
we wander through life.

481
00:53:57,135 --> 00:54:01,635
悲しみさえも 水に流してゆく
Washing away even our sadness with the water.

482
00:54:03,135 --> 00:54:08,435
錆びついた 自転車を走らせて 君へと向かうのさ
Riding on a rusted bicycle, I'm heading towards you.

483
00:54:09,635 --> 00:54:15,635
雨に濡れながら帰ろう
Let's go home, getting soaked in the rain.

484
00:54:19,135 --> 00:54:32,080
みんな お誕生日をお祝いしてくれてありがとう！ 幸福な誕生日になったよ！ 来年の誕生日も こうやってお祝いできますように！ ありがとう！
Everyone, thank you so much for celebrating my birthday! I've had such a happy birthday! I hope we can celebrate my birthday together like this next year too! Thank you!

